{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual puzzle game features beautiful graphics that make up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jianlongshan is located in Ninggan Township, Tiandeng County, Chongzuo City, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region. It is an undeveloped area with a mountain body resembling a dragon spine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164570/extras/34fd8e123db2e4a7390a4bb741e7c8c6.avif?t=1762822248\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game starts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on 'start game', the image will be grayed out, and the colored parts will be randomly scrambled into 16 small fragments, scattered randomly on the screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game process:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players click on the small image, drag it to its original position to restore it, until all the small images move to the correct position, and the game ends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End or start the next game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the small fragments move to the correct position, and the game ends. At this point, click &quot;try again&quot; to repeat the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4164570?t=1762822248","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4164570?t=1762822248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164570/2fed329a65a377390fc57c64ddf973f93902a103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762822248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164570/2fed329a65a377390fc57c64ddf973f93902a103/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762822248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"i